  "strategyNotes": [
    "ただし introduces an exception to the sentence before it. CDs and DVDs get their own rule.",
    "Limits come in pairs: number (十冊) and period (二週間). Do not mix book limits with CD limits.",
    "延長 has a condition (no reservation by others) and a count (一回だけ). Both can be tested."
